<title>THAILAND: Property Perfect Q3 net rises 66 pct.</title>
<headline>Property Perfect Q3 net rises 66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.06			2.01</p>
<p>    Net			134.19		     80.65</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.77			7.16</p>
<p>    Net			366.02		    286.59</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Property Perfect Plc, a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
